comments.body:
@kanems, thank you for the ticket. 

I am considering to keep MONDO:0023124 and relabel it as Dursun syndrome according to OMIM:612541. This is because familial pulmonary arterial hypertension leucopenia and atrial septal defect is an exact synonym to Dursun syndrome. Dursun syndrome is marked as "included" in OMIM which is considered as a related but different disease. Mondo currently has both terms as related synonym to MONDO:0012930 'autosomal recessive severe congenital neutropenia due to G6PC3 deficiency', so it's probably good to keep MONDO:0023124. When it is relabeled, OMIM:612541 and ORPHA:178503 will be added as dbxref. 

Please let me know if you have any concerns. Thanks.
